Subject: [PATCH 58/61] Playtest: Trainer Tower floors and more checkpoints

New checks: the Trainer Tower's single, double and knockout floors (the
foes mid-battle must be real species from that floor, at the player's
level), Misty's and Lt. Surge's gyms, buying at the berry stand and the
post-game held-item shop, and a Victory Road VS Seeker rematch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
